{"id":"52133a217eacf267","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornrecog.md","title":"Horn recognition from DNF is in coNP","display":"thm-hornrecog — Horn recognition from DNF is in coNP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornrecog","aliases":["27-thm-hornrecog"],"display":"thm-hornrecog — Horn recognition from DNF is in coNP","depends_on":["[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-conp]]","[[27-thm-hornchar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornrecog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornrecog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornrecog — Horn recognition from DNF is in coNP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9224d06d4526ac2\" href=\"?note=d9224d06d4526ac2\" title=\"27-df-conp\">27-df-conp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coNP}\">\\(\\mathbf{coNP}\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9224d06d4526ac2\" href=\"?note=d9224d06d4526ac2\" title=\"27-df-conp\">27-df-conp</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HORNREC}\">\\(\\mathrm{HORNREC}\\)</span> is the language to be defined over the binary alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF}\\)</span> is the explicit binary encoding of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>; malformed codes are rejected.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HORNREC}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{HORNREC}\\in\\mathbf{coNP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HORNREC}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{HORNREC}\\in\\mathbf{coNP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Theorem 6.5(a); §6.3, Theorem 6.6，印刷页 272;278，PDF 第 296;302 页（从 1 计数）。 核对本节点 membership 的完整证书论证：非 Hornness 由两个假点 a,b 及真点 a∧b 证明，编码长度约束保证证书及检验多项式。原书还给出 coNP 完全性；本节点只声称已展开证明的 membership。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conp","status":"resolved","id":"d9224d06d4526ac2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-conp]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]]; $\\mathbf{coNP}$ is defined in [[27-df-conp]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conp","status":"resolved","id":"d9224d06d4526ac2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]]; $\\mathbf{coNP}$ is defined in [[27-df-conp]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ is the explicit binary encoding of [[27-df-encoding]]; malformed codes are rejected.","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coNP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HORNREC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF}","display":